    "detailed_description": "SKATEBALLERS immerses players in atmospheric post-apocalyptic extreme roller football. The game is a sports simulator with the possibility of developing relationships with companions, where you can complete a story campaign in single-player mode.<br>Make quick attacks and score goals to win.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/64f8607e52c157363d9e4bc172a89d2c.poster.avif?t=1749201861\" width=348 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/64f8607e52c157363d9e4bc172a89d2c.webm?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/64f8607e52c157363d9e4bc172a89d2c.mp4?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight single combats with rivals, in the post-apocalypse world, all means are good for victory<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/54edefc89205359518abda851f2a1409.poster.avif?t=1749201861\" width=350 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/54edefc89205359518abda851f2a1409.webm?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/54edefc89205359518abda851f2a1409.mp4?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Avoid traps in the arenas<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/bf490f75eebb9a24b871ea49d3f85a97.poster.avif?t=1749201861\" width=352 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/bf490f75eebb9a24b871ea49d3f85a97.webm?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/bf490f75eebb9a24b871ea49d3f85a97.mp4?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Win new equipment, apply and combine equipment depending on the required parameters and conditions of the arena.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/70f62f71accff7d7ff08b52025cebe93.poster.avif?t=1749201861\" width=352 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/70f62f71accff7d7ff08b52025cebe93.webm?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/70f62f71accff7d7ff08b52025cebe93.mp4?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gather new players into the team, choose a partner with whom to go to the match, depending on his skills<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/mate_giff__1_.gif?t=1749201861\" width=352 height=158 /></span><br>Go through the history. Find out what the true purpose of the tournament is.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/48cef193053f1c747db1fd486dbef029.poster.avif?t=1749201861\" width=352 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/48cef193053f1c747db1fd486dbef029.webm?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/48cef193053f1c747db1fd486dbef029.mp4?t=1749201861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Travel around the city to win the tournament, save your lives, your neighborhood and decide if you want to return the city plunged into anarchy to normal life. The ending of the game depends on your choices during the tournament: who you go to the match with, who you play for.",
